<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $65-3/4.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $65-3/4.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened unchanged at $65-3/4 in New York on Tuesday, and rose to $65-7/8 in early trade.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 322.13 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
